From 5f879b5b0b38d20dbdc5aba9cbe80d7945029362 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yi Xie <imxieyi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 03:03:14 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 047/101] kosmickrisp: retire one-time command storage on
 completion

Transfer native command buffers and allocators to a completion-owned batch for one-time Vulkan submissions. Keep separate submitter and callback references so early feedback cannot release commit input storage.

Retain native queues until completion callbacks finish and guard asynchronous device reporting with a reference-counted context detached at Vulkan teardown. Add native weak-reference coverage for storage reclamation, rerecording, delayed feedback, and late error reporting.
